# Ferry Albatros, deck (C3, contract 34), 21 x 13. column = i, row = j. Look (the user's mock "Ferry cubierta"): planks, a railing along the south side (row 10) and the east
# side (column 19), the animated SEA beyond it (foam on the hull side, 2 frames), a funnel with its smoke, lifebuoys, crates and barrels, a porthole wall on the north / west sides and the hatch
# (a floor ladder, the door L) down to the cabins. The hero arrives from the gangway at the mats E (10..11, 1); stepping on them leaves the ship (script `ferry_exit`: after the captain's gift the
# ferry sails: flag 53). Two trainers (a sailor and a fisherman) watch the way to the hatch (they look north: the hero crosses their columns) and a deckhand talks.
@map ferry_cubierta
@size 21 13
@interior no
@bg 0
@nofollow yes                   # contract 69: the follower stays out of the ferry and the sea
@fill plank_o
@spawn gangway 10 2 S           # arriving from the gangway
@spawn hatch 3 4 S              # coming up from the cabins
@flag captain_done 52           # the captain gave the Cortador
@flag ferry_gone 53             # the ferry departed (set when the hero leaves after the captain)
@legend
  =  tile=plank_o                  # the deck planks
  W  tile=plank_o object=pwall     # the superstructure's porthole wall
  R  tile=plank_o object=rail_i
  Q  tile=plank_o object=rail_j
  O  tile=plank_o object=lifebuoy
  E  tile=plank_o interact=step script=ferry_exit
  F  tile=plank_o object=funnel
  H  tile=plank_o object=crate_plain
  T  tile=plank_o object=crate_stack
  b  tile=plank_o object=barrel
  L  tile=plank_o door=rope_ladder
  r  tile=sea_tr
  e  tile=sea_tl
  q  tile=sea_tl_tr
  w  tile=sea_o
  1  tile=plank_o npc=marinero id=d1 face=N trainer=marinero_f1 range=4 text=tr.marinero_f1.pre after=tr.marinero_f1.after
  2  tile=plank_o npc=pescador id=d2 face=E trainer=pescador_f range=5 text=tr.pescador_f.pre after=tr.pescador_f.after
  s  tile=plank_o npc=marinero id=hand face=SW text=ferry.deck.hand
  a  tile=plank_o item=disc_45
@grid
  WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWe
  W========OEEO====H=Qe
  W==============F==TQe
  W==L===============Qe
  W==================Qe
  W======1===========Qe
  W===========s======Qe
  W===2==============Qe
  W==================Qe
  Wab==========b=====Qe
  RRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRe
  rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrq
  wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwe
@warp L -> ferry_camarotes spawn=hatch
# Leaving the ship: without the captain's gift the hero simply walks down the gangway; with it the ferry sails away behind him
# (flag 53 hides the ferry and the gangway at the quay and they never come back).
@script ferry_exit step
    jnf captain_done out
    say ferry.horn
    setf ferry_gone
  out:
    warp muelle_dinamo spawn=quay
@end
